    "slug": "parliamentary-system-vs-presidential-system-explained",
    "title": "The Westminster System vs. American Presidential Separation of Powers: A Simple Guide",
    "headline": "The Westminster System vs. American Presidential Separation of Powers",
    "excerpt": "Comprehensive guide to parliamentary system vs presidential system. Learn practical steps, jurisdictional powers, and how to take civic action on Choseno.",
    "category": "civics",
    "publishedAt": "2026-09-07T18:28:29.580Z",
